Article 2 (Special cases concerning full-time executive officers)
(1) "At least 50 billion won" in the amended provisions of subparagraph 1 of Article 7 shall be construed as "at least 40 billion won" until September 8, 2013.
(2) Notwithstanding the amended provisions of subparagraphs 1 and 2 of Article 7, the previous provisions shall apply to full-time executive officers of a credit cooperative who hold office as at the time this Decree enters into force until the term of office of such executive officers expires.
Article 3 (Applicability to payment of contributions)
The amended provisions of Article 47 (3) shall begin to apply to credit cooperatives which have applied for authorization for incorporation and obtained such authorization after this Decree enters into force.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning authorization for authorization of credit cooperatives)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Articles 3 and 4, the previous provisions shall apply where an application for authorization for incorporation is filed pursuant to the previous provisions as at the time this Decree enters into force.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning grounds for disqualification of managing staff)
Where a person who is the managing staff of a credit cooperative or the Federation as at the time this Decree enters into force falls under disqualifications under the amended provisions of Article 10 (2) for reasons arising before this Decree enters into force, notwithstanding the same amended provisions, the previous provisions shall apply.
Article 6 (Transitional measures concerning representatives of Federation)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 24 (3), the previous provisions shall apply to representatives of the Federation who hold office as at the time this Decree enters into force until such term of office expires.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning member of management committee of depositor protection reserve)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 43, the previous provisions shall apply to members who hold office as at the time this Decree enters into force until such term of office expires.

